###############################################################################
# Vanilla Appliances Extended - .gitignore for a Project Zomboid mod
###############################################################################

## Test harness build output
# The runner is compiled from tests/harness/TestRunner.java on demand.
tests/build/

## IDE / editor cruft
.idea/
.vscode/
.vs/
*.iml
*.code-workspace
*.swp
*~

## OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

## Logs and crash artefacts, wherever they land
*.log
hs_err_pid*.log
logs/

###############################################################################
# Local-only reference material. NOT for publication.
#
# original-mods/ holds the unpacked source of the upstream mod this project
# continues, plus two further mods kept only as build 42 reference: a working
# fridge mod and one of the author's own projects. It is other people's work
# under other people's terms. Publishing it would redistribute all three.
#
# photoshop/ holds source artwork, including the sprite atlas recovered from
# the upstream texture pack. Those pixels are the original author's; the built
# texture pack ships inside the mod folder and is the only form that needs to
# be published.
#
# example-script-*.lua are the author's own scripts from an unrelated project,
# kept as a style reference only.
#
# Remove an entry only if you deliberately intend to publish it.
# See NOTICE and LICENSE.
###############################################################################
external-files/
context-files/
bug-reports/
original-mods/
photoshop/
example-script-*.lua
NOTES.md
